id: searx-feature-parity-plan
title: Complete local SearXNG feature parity and agent-ready CLI delivery
description: "Implement live-instance compatibility, complete command UX, global setup, format contracts, unlimited cache proof, and release-ready validation."
type: Plan
status: in_progress
priority: 0
tags[5]: agent,cli,e2e,searxng,toon
created_at: "2026-07-21T18:58:31.352Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-21T22:38:04.736Z"
deadline: "2026-07-23T18:58:31.352Z"
assignee: codex-root
author: codex-root
estimated_minutes: 420
acceptance_criteria: "Live searches succeed against http://192.168.1.183:38522 even when JSON format is disabled; Every advertised command has detailed help and global flags; TOON is the default and all programmatic formats validate; Global settings and all state live under ~/.searxng-cli; Unlimited persistent caching and cache reuse are proven; 100% coverage and full release gates pass; PR checks and bot reviews are clean and merged master is verified"
definition_of_ready: "All 52 existing pm items, current source, GitHub state, official SearXNG API docs, TOON spec, and local instance capabilities have been inspected."
parent: searx-modular-command-architecture
reviewer: repository-owner
risk: high
confidence: 85
sprint: 2026-07-feature-parity
release: next
