plan_decisions[2]{ts,author,decision,rationale,evidence}:
  "2026-07-21T18:58:35.178Z",codex-root,Use capability-aware JSON first with HTML fallback for disabled API formats.,"SearXNG intentionally returns 403 for disabled response formats, while the configured local service supports HTML search.",Official Search API docs plus live GET and POST probes on 2026-07-21.
  "2026-07-21T19:16:14.250Z",codex-root,"Use TypeScript 6.0.3, the newest release supported by typescript-eslint 8.65.0.",TypeScript 7.0.2 is the registry latest but lies outside the current typescript-eslint peer range >=4.8.4 <6.1.0; a mandatory type-aware ESLint gate cannot be dependency-clean on TS 7.,npm registry peer metadata checked 2026-07-21.
