body: "Single governed execution plan for the requested end-to-end delivery. Reuses the established architecture Feature and prior verification lineage; no duplicate recovery or coverage item is created.\n\nQuality addendum: all source and quality tooling must meet the user-mandated repo-wide gates. Coverage exclusions, ignore pragmas, mocked-only acceptance, duplicate tests, or threshold reductions are not valid completion evidence."
